WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.800
What if your shop understood what you wanted to achieve?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.700
Meet Veyndo: AI, apps and commerce, working together.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.700
Ask from the product, order or workspace you are already using.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.700
The agent connects your request to shop context and authorized app data.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:25.700
Bring existing products or describe the demo catalogue you want to create.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.700
Prepare content, translations and images, then review products in your private workspace.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.700
Give the design agent a reference URL, screenshot or design brief.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.700
Review its proposal in the real storefront preview. Keep editing visually.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.700
Create connected apps with visual tools and Veyndo AI, Codex or Claude Code.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.700
Interface, data and actions stay in one versioned app definition.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.700
Connect native events, app actions and reviewed work in the Flow Builder.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.700
Follow the execution history when the same process runs again.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:11.700
Generate fictional customer profiles from the selected catalogue and sales channel.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.700
Run purchase scenarios and inspect what succeeded, failed or exceeded a budget.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:22.700
Customers describe what they need and explore real products, prices and availability.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:27.700
Storyfront connects the experience to Veyndo’s native cart and embedded checkout.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:32.700
Agents, apps and storefronts use the same native commerce operations.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.700
Prices, stock and orders stay authoritative in the Rust core.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.700
Prepare changes privately. Review the exact proposal before it reaches your live shop.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.700
Dedicated planning agents have revocable identities, allowances and a stop control.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:51.700
Start with a goal. Build, test and publish connected changes.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.700
Explore Veyndo at veyndo.ai.
